        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sodium perchlorate, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sodium perchlorate, at plant
The process "sodium perchlorate, at plant, GLO" is modelled for the production of  sodium perchlorate from carbon sodium chlorate  in the world.  Raw materials are modelled with a stoechiometric calculation,  Emissions arew estimated. Energy consumptions are taken from literature. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
CAS number: 007601-89-0; 
Formula: NaClO4; 
UUID: 21787b8f-c7a7-3be4-981e-4a24995ff7ee
Production of sodium perchlorate including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Anodic oxidation of sodium chlorate
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Standard values 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_21787b8f-c7a7-3be4-981e-4a24995ff7ee.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
